  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRCiS III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRCiS  III  will  contribute  to  the  increased resilience  capacity  and  reduced  humanitarian  needs  of  at  least 1,019,330  Somalis  (53%  female)  living  in  rural  settlements  or  small towns and sharing common disaster-affected eco-, market, and local leadership systems across 10 regions and 21 districts.</narrative>
